{
  "_comment": [
    "Intentional upstream identifiers kept on purpose. Everything here is internal (never",
    "rendered to users) or a compatibility contract that must not change:",
    "  - the `window.ferdium` recipes API, `ferdiumVersion`, shortcut keys, Stores/Routes",
    "  - `Ferdium:` debug namespaces / IPC channel names",
    "  - settings + persistence keys and i18n message IDs (their values are sanitized at runtime)",
    "  - `.ferdium-data` import/export extension and `ferdium-user-*` storage keys (compatibility)",
    "  - DBus interface names, SCREAMING_CASE constants, comments and console/dev logging",
    "`wholeLinePatterns` skip the entire line; `linePatterns` only neutralize the matched",
    "substring, so a real leak elsewhere on the same line is still reported."
  ],
  "files": [
    "src/@types/ferdium.types.ts",
    "src/lib/DBus.ts",
    "src/lib/dbus/Ferdium.ts",
    "src/brand.generated.ts",
    "src/i18n/brand-i18n.ts",
    "src/i18n/brand-intl.tsx",
    "scripts/apply-brand.mjs",
    "scripts/check-brand.mjs",
    "WHITE_LABEL.md",
    "docs/brand-allowlist.json"
  ],
  "wholeLinePatterns": [
    "^\\s*//",
    "^\\s*#",
    "^\\s*\\*",
    "^\\s*/\\*",
    "^\\s*console\\.",
    "\\bdebug\\(['\"`]",
    "^\\s*['\"]ferdium['\"],?\\s*$",
    "migrateLog\\("
  ],
  "linePatterns": [
